//! Sounio semantic authority for Operator Orbit Canonicalization V13.
//!
//! The matcher-free first executable is preserved at commit 73704f7afe. This
//! post-result source keeps the generating computation unchanged and confines
//! observed V13 counts and digests to the frozen replay matcher below. No
//! parity implementation supplied or revised those expected results.

